WEBVTT

01:18.700 --> 01:21.830
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.020 --> 01:24.950
[Episode 16]

01:26.950 --> 01:27.560
Ruohai,

01:28.710 --> 01:29.950
you didn't lie to me

01:30.789 --> 01:32.789
about what happened today, did you?

01:34.840 --> 01:36.840
No, I didn't. What are you thinking?

01:39.150 --> 01:39.880
That's good.

01:43.950 --> 01:46.000
No matter what happens in the future,

01:46.000 --> 01:47.460
you must tell me the truth.

02:03.280 --> 02:04.190
I'm back.

02:49.079 --> 02:50.079
Landlady,

02:51.079 --> 02:51.960
are you asleep?

03:00.560 --> 03:01.910
You've been... drinking?

03:01.910 --> 03:02.910
-What?
-Hurry...

03:03.280 --> 03:03.840
Hurry!

03:03.840 --> 03:04.560
What's wrong with you?

03:04.560 --> 03:06.960
Hurry! Go heat up
the midnight snack for me.

03:07.310 --> 03:09.240
You're crazy. Heat it up yourself.

03:11.190 --> 03:13.190
If you still don't pull your foot back,

03:13.190 --> 03:14.590
I'll crush it with the door,
believe it or not.

03:14.590 --> 03:15.190
Just do it.

03:16.190 --> 03:17.190
If you do crush it,

03:17.280 --> 03:20.340
you'll have to sell the house
to cover my medical bills.

03:20.400 --> 03:21.030
Do it.

03:23.150 --> 03:25.150
You're harassing your landlady
in the middle of the night.

03:25.150 --> 03:27.260
Aren't you afraid I'll scream

03:27.360 --> 03:30.160
and make you
the neighborhood headline tomorrow?

03:33.910 --> 03:34.440
Qian Fei.

03:37.120 --> 03:39.520
Did you save that food
specifically for me?

03:42.360 --> 03:43.150
Why?

03:45.160 --> 03:46.120
Because...

03:47.400 --> 03:49.430
you helped me teach Wang Ruohai a lesson.

03:49.430 --> 03:50.190
So thank you.

03:56.520 --> 03:58.050
Then I'll heat it up for you.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.290
I'm coming.

04:22.870 --> 04:25.160
What's been up with you lately?

04:25.160 --> 04:26.390
You've been acting weird.

04:26.390 --> 04:28.510
You hide in your room and lie in bed

04:28.680 --> 04:30.310
as soon as you get home.

04:30.310 --> 04:31.640
What exactly happened?

04:32.390 --> 04:33.240
What do you mean?

04:33.240 --> 04:35.270
I'm just going to sleep.

04:37.560 --> 04:39.000
Son, did you run into

04:39.000 --> 04:40.430
any problems at work?

04:40.600 --> 04:43.270
If you can't solve it, just tell us.

04:43.560 --> 04:46.000
Your dad and I will try to work out a way.

04:46.020 --> 04:46.820
That's right.

04:47.430 --> 04:50.360
No, there are no problems at work.

04:51.240 --> 04:53.360
Then are you at odds with Yifei?

04:53.430 --> 04:54.630
Did you two have a fight?

04:54.630 --> 04:56.270
Of course not.

04:56.800 --> 04:58.600
Then it must be relationship problems.

04:58.600 --> 05:00.930
Is that girl distancing herself from you?

05:01.480 --> 05:03.750
No! It's not like that!
You're so annoying.

05:03.750 --> 05:05.240
Get out now. I want to sleep.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.600
Boy, you're such a pain in the neck!

05:06.600 --> 05:08.120
Can't you just tell us about it?

05:08.120 --> 05:09.120
Get out of my room.

05:09.390 --> 05:10.240
Let's go.

05:11.680 --> 05:12.720
Geez.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.490
You've gone too far.

05:34.040 --> 05:34.800
Dear.

05:36.510 --> 05:38.040
Well, what do you think

05:38.630 --> 05:41.120
has been going on with our son lately?

05:44.120 --> 05:46.270
He got rejected by the girl he pursued,

05:46.510 --> 05:47.909
so he's lost confidence.

05:48.190 --> 05:49.430
No way!

05:50.310 --> 05:51.909
Our son is such a great catch.

05:51.950 --> 05:55.600
He should be the one picking others.
How could he lack confidence?

05:55.600 --> 05:57.130
Don't you know your own son?

06:02.270 --> 06:03.600
Dear, think about it.

06:04.010 --> 06:05.480
When I was pursuing you,

06:05.510 --> 06:06.640
I was also rejected.

06:07.040 --> 06:08.900
Didn't my dejected look resemble

06:09.190 --> 06:10.590
the way our son looks now?

06:11.270 --> 06:12.730
Think about it carefully.

06:14.430 --> 06:15.430
You're right.

06:18.680 --> 06:21.480
I've tasted that feeling
of doubting myself.

06:22.070 --> 06:22.930
It was not good.

06:24.120 --> 06:25.510
Don't be disgusting.

06:30.840 --> 06:33.500
Cancel that photo exhibition tomorrow.

06:34.260 --> 06:36.520
We've had an appointment. Why cancel it?

06:36.750 --> 06:37.600
What's more important—

06:37.600 --> 06:40.930
the photo exhibition or getting
our son's confidence back?

06:43.240 --> 06:45.120
You already have a plan so quickly?

06:45.120 --> 06:46.000
Of course.

06:47.480 --> 06:49.310
Who is my brain for?

06:49.430 --> 06:50.630
For our son.

06:58.360 --> 06:59.120
Leader,

06:59.830 --> 07:02.680
well, I'd like to borrow

07:02.680 --> 07:04.680
the dance troupe's spare speakers.

07:05.270 --> 07:06.070
Let's go.

07:06.430 --> 07:07.120
Come on, be careful.

07:07.120 --> 07:09.000
Aren't these the dance troupe's speakers?

07:09.000 --> 07:10.730
How did they end up in our house?

07:11.720 --> 07:12.600
Maybe it's because

07:12.600 --> 07:14.600
our house is closer to the park.

07:14.870 --> 07:15.630
Let's go.

07:16.560 --> 07:19.480
-Mom, I really don't want to go to the park.
-Yeah, we're heading out.

07:19.480 --> 07:20.070
We're heading out.

07:20.070 --> 07:20.750
Just let

07:20.780 --> 07:22.390
-my dad drive. You two can go.
-When you're feeling down...

07:22.390 --> 07:23.600
Hey, let me tell you.

07:23.670 --> 07:26.000
It's the weekend.
We should go to the park to get

07:26.000 --> 07:26.720
some fresh air, right?

07:26.720 --> 07:28.560
-Yeah, the air is great.
-Open the door.

07:28.560 --> 07:29.290
I'll open it.

07:31.870 --> 07:32.510
Well...

07:32.920 --> 07:35.850
-Put the things away.
-Yes, we're putting them away.

07:36.390 --> 07:37.920
Well, let Jun drive.

07:37.920 --> 07:38.800
Let Dad drive.

07:39.360 --> 07:41.159
Your dad drank this morning!

07:41.320 --> 07:42.390
I had a little this morning.

07:42.390 --> 07:43.790
Didn't you drink coffee?

07:44.159 --> 07:45.480
-It's changed. Get in.
-Get in now.

07:45.480 --> 07:46.270
Get in, come on.

07:46.270 --> 07:46.870
Here's the key.

07:46.870 --> 07:47.430
Okay.

07:48.070 --> 07:48.390
Alright.

07:48.390 --> 07:48.920
Hurry up.

07:49.000 --> 07:51.580
It would be drunk driving
if your dad drove.

07:59.750 --> 08:01.430
The weather is so nice today.

08:02.160 --> 08:02.720
Yeah.

08:03.270 --> 08:05.470
It's so sunny without a cloud in the sky.

08:22.030 --> 08:22.360
Mom.

08:23.630 --> 08:24.870
Isn't dancing site over there?

08:24.870 --> 08:25.870
You're taking a detour.

08:25.870 --> 08:27.360
There's construction going on there.

08:27.360 --> 08:27.870
Follow me.

08:27.870 --> 08:28.330
Come on.

08:28.360 --> 08:29.750
-Follow me, follow me.
-Go with your mom.

08:29.750 --> 08:30.610
It's over here.

08:36.200 --> 08:37.120
Right here.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.960
Here we are. Yes, it's just up ahead.

08:38.960 --> 08:41.030
Look, there's an umbrella over there.

08:41.030 --> 08:42.669
-Let's go under this umbrella.
-Right here!

08:42.669 --> 08:43.530
It's cool here.

08:43.659 --> 08:45.360
Come on, give this to me.

08:45.630 --> 08:46.440
Mom.

08:46.840 --> 08:48.840
Didn't you come to dance?
What are we doing here?

08:47.730 --> 08:48.920
[Excellent Single Man] [Seeking a Match]

08:48.940 --> 08:50.860
[Seeking a Match]

08:49.000 --> 08:50.270
They haven't arrived yet.

08:50.270 --> 08:52.200
The Leader and the others
will probably be here soon.

08:52.200 --> 08:53.120
Just wait for their arrival.

08:53.120 --> 08:53.550
Yes.

08:55.440 --> 08:55.870
Okay.

08:55.910 --> 08:57.150
You guys take a rest here.

08:57.150 --> 08:59.200
I'll go buy you some water.

08:59.840 --> 09:00.510
-Okay.
-Nice.

09:00.510 --> 09:01.180
Come back early.

09:01.180 --> 09:05.440
-Come back soon.
-A handsome post-90s, 180 cm tall.

09:06.670 --> 09:09.360
-Won college scholarships every year.
-Mom, what are you doing?

09:09.360 --> 09:10.960
What are you doing, Mom? Turn it off!

09:10.960 --> 09:11.440
No!

09:11.550 --> 09:12.460
No, Mom!

09:12.510 --> 09:13.390
Stop shouting.

09:14.120 --> 09:16.150
Yes, it's my son.

09:16.150 --> 09:17.680
He's good-looking, right?

09:18.600 --> 09:20.030
Look at my son.

09:21.120 --> 09:24.080
He became a civil servant
right after graduating from college?

09:24.080 --> 09:24.600
Yes.

09:24.600 --> 09:26.270
A local civil servant is a great job!

09:26.270 --> 09:26.720
Yes.

09:26.740 --> 09:29.320
My daughter with a master's degree is
a perfect match for you.

09:29.320 --> 09:30.180
-Yes.
-Really?

09:30.270 --> 09:32.840
If he hadn't passed
the exam on the first try,

09:32.960 --> 09:34.440
he would have pursued
a master's degree, too.

09:34.440 --> 09:34.960
Yes.

09:35.080 --> 09:35.720
He's very excellent.

09:35.720 --> 09:38.030
My daughter is a postdoc
at Fudan University.

09:38.030 --> 09:39.290
She likes younger men.

09:39.320 --> 09:39.960
Younger?

09:40.000 --> 09:41.360
It doesn't matter if he's 5 years younger.

09:41.360 --> 09:42.670
The girl is 5 years older?

09:42.670 --> 09:43.800
That won't work. No.

09:44.240 --> 09:44.840
No, no way.

09:45.670 --> 09:46.910
Let me add you on WeChat.

09:46.910 --> 09:48.640
Our daughter is from Shanghai.

09:49.240 --> 09:50.030
Scan the QR code.

09:50.030 --> 09:50.780
Right.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.870
Scan the QR code and add him on WeChat.

09:52.870 --> 09:53.200
Okay.

09:53.390 --> 09:54.000
Alright.

09:54.840 --> 09:55.900
We'll wait for you.

09:57.910 --> 09:58.440
Over here.

09:58.440 --> 09:59.700
Let us scan the QR code.

10:02.510 --> 10:03.960
Come on. Take your time.

10:03.960 --> 10:04.630
Take your time.

10:04.630 --> 10:06.240
One by one, one by one.

10:06.240 --> 10:07.700
Please step back a little.

10:07.750 --> 10:09.750
We're waiting for him to add us back.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.330
Our daughter is quite pretty.

10:13.870 --> 10:15.790
Over here. Where do we scan the QR code?

10:15.790 --> 10:16.270
Dear.

10:17.360 --> 10:17.920
Look.

10:17.940 --> 10:18.510
Look.

10:20.150 --> 10:21.910
Is that the girl we saw on the phone

10:21.910 --> 10:23.050
the other day?

10:23.150 --> 10:23.630
Look.

10:25.030 --> 10:26.360
Are you done scanning?

10:27.950 --> 10:28.510
How about this?

10:28.510 --> 10:29.670
I-I'll go find my son and tell him

10:29.670 --> 10:30.630
to add you back right away.

10:30.630 --> 10:31.080
Okay?

10:31.200 --> 10:32.040
He can add you.

10:32.150 --> 10:34.090
He'll add you later... Later...

10:35.150 --> 10:36.320
Okay, we got it.

10:36.320 --> 10:37.080
I got it.

10:37.080 --> 10:37.610
Let's go.

10:38.200 --> 10:39.480
Don't forget to accept the friend request!

10:39.480 --> 10:40.880
I got it!

10:44.550 --> 10:45.440
What's up?

10:46.000 --> 10:46.790
I'm here...

10:48.080 --> 10:49.540
You didn't see it, did you?

10:49.910 --> 10:50.510
What?

10:51.240 --> 10:52.390
I just came for a run.

10:54.120 --> 10:56.380
Don't follow me if there's nothing else.

10:58.600 --> 10:59.600
Are they over there?

10:59.600 --> 11:00.730
Looks like they are.

11:01.630 --> 11:02.840
Speed up!

11:17.720 --> 11:18.210
Dear.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.300
What are you doing?

11:19.480 --> 11:20.120
It'll give me a heart attack.

11:20.120 --> 11:21.600
I really can't run anymore.

11:21.600 --> 11:23.460
You're really dropping the ball.

11:23.720 --> 11:25.150
How about you rest here for a bit?

11:25.150 --> 11:25.790
Okay.

11:25.790 --> 11:27.390
I must catch up to take a look.

11:27.840 --> 11:30.100
Let me see exactly why she is so arrogant.

11:33.120 --> 11:35.080
This brat runs too fast.

11:35.820 --> 11:36.530
No way.

11:36.790 --> 11:37.910
Dear, wait for me.

11:38.750 --> 11:39.510
Wait for me.

12:15.200 --> 12:17.130
What kind of fitness level is this?

12:20.670 --> 12:22.530
What do you want with me? Go ahead.

12:26.870 --> 12:28.730
It really was a chance encounter.

12:29.840 --> 12:32.320
But since we've bumped into each other,

12:33.600 --> 12:35.400
I'll shamelessly ask you again.

12:36.910 --> 12:39.440
What is it about me
that doesn't appeal to you?

12:40.270 --> 12:40.870
Well,

12:41.510 --> 12:42.970
my relatives, my friends,

12:43.360 --> 12:44.320
and those

12:45.120 --> 12:46.480
who just met me

12:46.960 --> 12:48.030
all think

12:48.720 --> 12:49.650
I'm pretty good,

12:49.910 --> 12:51.510
with excellent conditions.

12:52.150 --> 12:54.960
Why do you, only you,
think I'm not good enough?

12:56.190 --> 12:57.030
Not having seen you for days,

12:57.030 --> 12:58.360
I thought you had figured it out,

12:58.360 --> 12:59.600
and we could still be friends.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.530
But you just ran over to ask me this?

13:02.910 --> 13:04.510
I really can't figure it out.

13:04.670 --> 13:05.600
You can't figure it out

13:05.600 --> 13:07.400
because you're still a big baby.

13:08.270 --> 13:08.770
Am I?

13:09.320 --> 13:10.270
Aren't you?

13:10.950 --> 13:12.100
I rejected you,

13:12.200 --> 13:13.550
but instead of thinking about

13:13.550 --> 13:14.670
your own problems like an adult,

13:14.670 --> 13:17.070
you ran to me and asked
why I turned you down.

13:17.150 --> 13:19.600
When you like someone,
you just pursue them blindly.

13:19.600 --> 13:20.870
Has it ever occurred to you

13:20.870 --> 13:21.670
how much trouble

13:21.670 --> 13:23.330
your behavior would cause me?

13:25.320 --> 13:27.200
You're like a child who hasn't grown up.

13:27.200 --> 13:28.360
You don't care about others' feelings

13:28.360 --> 13:29.840
and only listen to your mother.

13:29.840 --> 13:31.140
Your mom told you to drink more milk,

13:31.140 --> 13:33.670
so you went to a bar
and ordered a glass of milk.

13:33.750 --> 13:35.080
I'm not like you.

13:35.600 --> 13:37.620
I am independent and love freedom.

13:37.890 --> 13:39.110
So the man I want is

13:39.200 --> 13:41.260
definitely not a mama's boy like you.

13:43.200 --> 13:44.080
To me,

13:44.600 --> 13:47.400
you can only be Prime Minister,
and I can only be Bad Name.

13:47.400 --> 13:49.700
Any other relationship is
absolutely impossible.

13:49.700 --> 13:51.300
Do you understand this time?

14:07.320 --> 14:09.510
She is Bad Name.

14:11.960 --> 14:13.570
"Mama's boy"? What's wrong
with a mama's boy?

14:13.570 --> 14:15.050
So funny. I...

14:18.630 --> 14:20.130
What are you doing?

14:20.250 --> 14:21.990
Don't embarrass our son, okay?

14:24.120 --> 14:25.620
She hasn't had kids herself!

14:25.620 --> 14:26.460
After she has kids,

14:26.460 --> 14:28.160
she won't think this way.

14:28.750 --> 14:30.610
S-She would surely cherish them!

14:33.840 --> 14:35.240
This is so weird.

14:37.270 --> 14:38.080
Did he leave?

14:38.150 --> 14:39.080
He's going home.

14:50.600 --> 14:53.240
When you like someone,
you just pursue them blindly.

14:53.240 --> 14:54.360
Has it ever occurred to you

14:54.360 --> 14:55.240
how much trouble

14:55.240 --> 14:56.900
your behavior would cause me?

15:14.240 --> 15:15.530
I'm not like you.

15:16.190 --> 15:18.120
I am independent and love freedom.

15:18.390 --> 15:19.680
So the man I want is

15:19.720 --> 15:21.780
definitely not a mama's boy like you.

15:38.320 --> 15:39.390
I really can't take it anymore.

15:39.390 --> 15:42.000
You couldn't even handle
this little bit of exercise?

15:42.000 --> 15:43.470
My body can't take it.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.720
You are amazing.

15:46.600 --> 15:47.730
I really admire you.

15:48.950 --> 15:50.520
I really don't understand.

15:51.440 --> 15:53.030
That young girl doesn't

15:53.030 --> 15:53.870
even look that good.

15:53.870 --> 15:55.670
How could she look down on my son?

15:56.270 --> 15:58.730
And she even questioned
my way of education!

15:59.200 --> 16:01.010
She basically doesn't understand.

16:01.010 --> 16:02.790
Behind such an excellent boy,

16:03.030 --> 16:05.670
there must be a great mother

16:05.670 --> 16:07.550
educating and guiding him.

16:10.120 --> 16:12.320
Otherwise, how could there be
such an excellent child?

16:12.320 --> 16:12.870
Indeed.

16:16.720 --> 16:18.530
She really doesn't know how rare

16:18.700 --> 16:20.960
such excellent children are in society.

16:21.000 --> 16:24.330
And she said, "The man I want is
definitely not a mama's boy."

16:24.600 --> 16:25.320
Fine!

16:25.870 --> 16:27.360
Then you... You go find one!

16:27.360 --> 16:29.120
Some Iron Man or Spider-Man.

16:29.200 --> 16:30.600
Go and try to find one!

16:32.750 --> 16:33.240
Dear.

16:35.270 --> 16:36.200
I think

16:36.750 --> 16:37.480
maybe we should

16:37.480 --> 16:39.410
loosen the reins a bit for our child

16:39.720 --> 16:42.320
and give him some space to develop freely,

16:42.390 --> 16:42.910
huh?

16:44.750 --> 16:46.080
Didn't I give him space?

16:46.480 --> 16:48.600
I gave him so much space!

16:50.750 --> 16:51.700
Sit down.

16:54.400 --> 16:55.640
Just because we were

16:55.640 --> 16:58.310
too lenient regarding his love affairs,

16:58.510 --> 16:59.750
as you saw today,

16:59.830 --> 17:01.400
our son ended up

17:01.800 --> 17:04.400
suffering physically
and being frustrated mentally.

17:04.400 --> 17:07.760
Dear, he needs our help.

17:07.790 --> 17:08.349
Yes.

17:09.440 --> 17:11.589
From now on,
you'll have the final say at home,

17:11.589 --> 17:12.220
okay?

17:12.640 --> 17:13.349
No way.

17:14.270 --> 17:16.790
I won't allow anyone
to say that about my son.

17:17.240 --> 17:18.960
I need to go find her. Now.

17:19.900 --> 17:23.530
Dear, dear, dear! The bus is here.

18:01.000 --> 18:01.680
Landlady!

18:03.350 --> 18:04.030
Landlady!

18:05.240 --> 18:07.040
Why did you eat instant noodles?

18:08.110 --> 18:09.240
Aren't you cooking?

18:10.510 --> 18:11.550
Be quiet.

18:49.270 --> 18:51.350
Well, I ordered too much takeout.

18:51.350 --> 18:53.480
I can't finish it all. Do you want some?

18:55.110 --> 18:57.350
Fine, I'll throw it away
if you don't want it.

18:57.350 --> 18:58.610
I want it. Keep it here.

18:59.920 --> 19:02.050
Well, then, I'll leave it at your door.

19:05.680 --> 19:08.160
What? You won't even say thank you?

19:09.680 --> 19:12.080
Seriously, what are you doing
in your room?

19:12.880 --> 19:14.480
I haven't seen you in a while.

19:16.310 --> 19:17.680
You're acting weird.

19:47.920 --> 19:49.310
Why didn't you eat?

19:51.000 --> 19:54.260
What are you trying to do,
without even eating or drinking?

19:54.350 --> 19:56.410
Are you trying to become an immortal?

20:00.770 --> 20:02.030
Are you okay, Qian Fei?

20:02.960 --> 20:03.880
Qian Fei?

20:05.400 --> 20:07.000
Qian Fei, what are you doing?

20:07.960 --> 20:08.720
Qian Fei!

20:10.200 --> 20:10.920
Geez.

20:12.000 --> 20:12.720
What's with your state?

20:12.720 --> 20:14.400
What happened?

20:16.510 --> 20:17.750
It's finally done.

20:19.110 --> 20:19.920
I can eat now.

20:22.200 --> 20:24.860
What have you been busy with
these past few days?

20:25.050 --> 20:26.380
I haven't even seen you.

20:27.480 --> 20:29.090
Let me heat it up for you. It's too cold.

20:29.090 --> 20:31.020
No need. I'll just eat it like this.

20:34.150 --> 20:37.110
I took on a translation project
to earn some extra money.

20:37.110 --> 20:38.440
With a tight schedule and heavy workload,

20:38.440 --> 20:39.900
I haven't slept for 2 days.

20:40.880 --> 20:42.810
You've been burning yourself out.

20:43.030 --> 20:44.560
Are you that short of money?

20:44.830 --> 20:46.090
Not as short as you are.

20:46.400 --> 20:48.130
If you need money, just tell me.

20:48.160 --> 20:49.240
You can work for me.

20:49.260 --> 20:50.960
My work is easy and pays well.

20:52.920 --> 20:54.350
Looks like you really are cash-strapped.

20:54.350 --> 20:56.550
Don't worry, Wang Ruohai can't

20:56.590 --> 20:58.680
get you out of Shan Li Fang anytime soon.

20:58.680 --> 21:00.720
I don't even have the strength
to break apart chopsticks.

21:00.720 --> 21:03.180
Wang Ruohai can't get you
out of Shan Li Fang.

21:03.920 --> 21:05.500
Fang Yun will protect you.

21:05.640 --> 21:07.630
Besides, you're still
my special assistant, right?

21:07.630 --> 21:09.350
As for the money you owe him,

21:10.310 --> 21:12.240
we have to follow the rules, right?

21:13.240 --> 21:14.720
About the money you owed before,

21:14.720 --> 21:16.110
s-see if there's an IOU.

21:16.130 --> 21:16.990
I'll help you check it.

21:16.450 --> 21:17.260
[Senior Yuan Qin]

21:19.310 --> 21:20.350
Hello, Senior.

21:20.960 --> 21:22.240
It's almost done.

21:22.240 --> 21:24.700
I'll just double-check it
and send it to you.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.540
It won't be delayed. It won't.

21:27.320 --> 21:28.710
Okay, okay. Bye.

21:38.020 --> 21:40.680
You're probably the only one
who'd dare to take such an urgent job.

21:40.680 --> 21:43.080
You've been disregarding your own health.

21:45.270 --> 21:47.070
Let me heat it up for you. It's cold.

21:47.070 --> 21:50.730
It's fine as it is. I'll starve to death
if I wait for it to be heated.

21:59.790 --> 22:00.480
Is it good?

22:04.270 --> 22:05.330
Aren't you eating?

22:07.530 --> 22:13.590
[Printing Room]

22:40.400 --> 22:42.200
Jingjing, what brings you here?

22:43.370 --> 22:44.510
What brings me here?

22:44.540 --> 22:46.070
You don't know why I'm here?

22:48.040 --> 22:49.370
You forgot, didn't you?

22:53.590 --> 22:54.550
I forgot.

22:54.960 --> 22:55.810
My bad.

22:57.790 --> 23:01.190
I promised to go furniture shopping
with you this afternoon.

23:02.310 --> 23:04.640
Why didn't you even have time
to eat your takeout?

23:04.640 --> 23:05.790
It's already cold.

23:06.200 --> 23:08.600
Due to a tight schedule
and heavy workload.

23:09.240 --> 23:11.240
Then why isn't there
anyone else working overtime?

23:10.100 --> 23:14.350
[Printing Room]

23:11.920 --> 23:14.510
I have to sort this all out
a few days early,

23:15.070 --> 23:16.330
so I can have spare time

23:16.400 --> 23:18.660
to take on some side jobs for extra money.

23:19.610 --> 23:21.210
Is it because of Wang Ruohai?

23:23.090 --> 23:24.910
The sooner I pay him back, the better.

23:24.910 --> 23:26.880
I don't want to owe him anything anymore.

23:26.880 --> 23:28.000
I have money. I'll give it to you.

23:28.000 --> 23:28.680
Stop it.

23:28.680 --> 23:29.830
You're getting married soon.

23:29.830 --> 23:31.830
It's exactly when you need money most.

23:31.830 --> 23:33.560
I can still scrape it together.

23:34.510 --> 23:36.720
Look how exhausted you are now.

23:37.110 --> 23:39.240
Are you going to kill yourself
working this hard?

23:39.240 --> 23:40.030
Jingjing,

23:40.720 --> 23:41.750
I can't

23:42.440 --> 23:43.500
go shopping today.

23:43.960 --> 23:45.440
How about you go find Lu Ze?

23:47.000 --> 23:47.680
Fine.

23:48.640 --> 23:49.350
Hurry up and go now.

23:49.350 --> 23:50.240
If it gets any later,

23:50.240 --> 23:51.570
the mall will be closed.

23:55.270 --> 23:56.160
Do you hate me?

23:57.960 --> 23:58.550
Yes.

23:59.350 --> 24:00.240
Don't hate me.

24:01.620 --> 24:02.960
Alright, get back to your work.

24:02.960 --> 24:04.220
Take care of yourself.

24:04.440 --> 24:05.750
Don't overwork too much.

24:05.750 --> 24:06.350
Got it.

24:07.310 --> 24:08.790
Call me if you need anything.

24:08.790 --> 24:09.270
Bye-bye.

24:09.270 --> 24:09.800
Bye-bye.

24:16.510 --> 24:17.910
Can I call you back later?

24:20.030 --> 24:23.630
I can't really talk about
the divestment plan with you right now.

24:23.720 --> 24:24.390
How can I...

24:24.480 --> 24:26.720
-How can we discuss this on the phone?
-I think this sofa will

24:26.720 --> 24:28.580
fit in the living room quite well.

24:29.310 --> 24:29.720
I know.

24:29.720 --> 24:31.980
-Lu Ze?
-I'm already overwhelmed, okay?

24:34.880 --> 24:36.610
Well, I'll call you back later.

24:38.000 --> 24:39.680
Are we still shopping?
We don't have to if you're busy.

24:39.680 --> 24:40.270
Yes, we are.

24:40.270 --> 24:41.480
Didn't I just hang up?

24:42.310 --> 24:43.720
Jingjing, the thing is that

24:43.720 --> 24:45.450
our Xinxin Vision recently...

24:45.590 --> 24:47.920
If Qian Fei weren't so swamped
with work these days,

24:47.920 --> 24:49.400
I would have had her come with me.

24:49.400 --> 24:51.060
She could give me some advice.

24:51.350 --> 24:53.480
I just said that this sofa would fit

24:53.480 --> 24:54.920
in the living room quite well.

24:54.920 --> 24:55.520
Jingjing.

24:56.550 --> 24:58.880
Our company has had something
coming up recently.

24:58.880 --> 24:59.750
So...

25:00.000 --> 25:01.480
I don't know the specifics

25:01.480 --> 25:03.010
of your company's affairs.

25:03.270 --> 25:06.160
If it were PR or publicity,

25:06.200 --> 25:08.530
I could still help you brainstorm, right?

25:09.590 --> 25:12.960
Okay, let's not talk about the company.
I'll focus on keeping you company.

25:12.960 --> 25:15.160
I do have enough money
to pay Wang Ruohai back,

25:15.160 --> 25:16.960
but right before the wedding,

25:17.160 --> 25:19.440
bringing up
lending money to someone else to Lu Ze

25:19.440 --> 25:20.960
is indeed inappropriate.

25:21.000 --> 25:21.400
Um...

25:22.460 --> 25:23.190
You go first.

25:25.750 --> 25:27.810
Has Qian Fei contacted you recently?

25:29.190 --> 25:32.550
I was just saying that Qian Fei's been
swamped with work these days.

25:32.550 --> 25:34.880
She's busy with Shan Li Fang's listing,

25:34.900 --> 25:37.360
while Wang Ruohai is
hounding her for money.

25:37.590 --> 25:39.120
I really feel sorry for her.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.550
So I was thinking...

25:40.550 --> 25:43.950
You feel sorry for her,
but she might not feel the same for you.

25:44.310 --> 25:45.240
What do you mean?

25:45.750 --> 25:47.410
Are you trying to sow discord?

25:48.550 --> 25:49.510
No, I'm not.

25:49.750 --> 25:50.880
I... I'm not.

25:52.250 --> 25:53.720
Okay, I won't talk about it anymore.

25:53.720 --> 25:54.850
Let's drop it, okay?

25:55.110 --> 25:56.770
Let's go furniture shopping.

26:25.700 --> 26:32.340
[Bank Card]

27:04.590 --> 27:06.850
You didn't call me to join you
for a drink?

27:08.510 --> 27:09.270
My bad.

27:15.710 --> 27:17.140
You're in a bad mood,

27:17.400 --> 27:18.900
but you'd rather sit here drinking alone

27:18.900 --> 27:20.050
than talk to me.

27:22.110 --> 27:24.720
I'm not just sharing your happiness.

27:25.400 --> 27:28.260
I can also be there for you
when you're feeling down.

27:31.790 --> 27:34.680
I've just been under a bit
too much pressure at work lately.

27:34.680 --> 27:35.640
Isn't everything

27:35.640 --> 27:37.880
going in the right direction, anyway?

27:38.240 --> 27:41.160
Besides, sometimes pressure
can be a motivation.

27:42.110 --> 27:43.970
It's not necessarily a bad thing.

27:48.030 --> 27:49.270
I know what you mean,

27:49.640 --> 27:53.030
but I just feel a bit suffocated.

28:06.160 --> 28:08.350
I've really been working hard on R&D,

28:09.880 --> 28:11.410
like working day and night.

28:12.210 --> 28:13.040
However,

28:14.880 --> 28:16.880
I just can't present a nice product.

28:25.640 --> 28:26.880
I want to blame someone,

28:26.880 --> 28:28.620
but in the end, I realize...

28:33.350 --> 28:35.410
I can only blame my own incompetence.

28:39.310 --> 28:40.750
You can't say that.

28:42.110 --> 28:44.220
I know you are a perfectionist.

28:45.030 --> 28:47.510
Good things are never easy to make,

28:47.590 --> 28:48.160
right?

28:49.400 --> 28:51.530
And I think there's one thing about you

28:52.030 --> 28:53.230
that's really great.

28:53.290 --> 28:55.750
It's something I admire
very much about you.

28:55.790 --> 28:57.890
Despite being a STEM guy,

28:58.220 --> 28:59.860
you have your ideal.

29:00.970 --> 29:02.620
You must hold on to that.

29:13.070 --> 29:14.070
Jingjing.

29:15.750 --> 29:17.550
You're all I need in this life.

29:49.980 --> 29:52.090
I'm looking for your group's CFO,
Wang Ruohai.

29:52.090 --> 29:53.120
Please contact him for me.

29:53.120 --> 29:55.200
Excuse me. Do you have an appointment?

29:55.200 --> 29:56.660
Tell him I'm Yao Jingjing.

29:56.920 --> 29:59.050
He will see me
whether I have an appointment or not.

29:59.050 --> 30:00.580
Okay, please wait a moment.

30:06.640 --> 30:07.790
I am very calm right now.

30:07.790 --> 30:09.680
I just want an explanation.
Is there any problem with that?

30:09.680 --> 30:11.720
Sir, please leave here first.

30:11.750 --> 30:13.200
We have no obligation
to discuss this matter with you.

30:13.200 --> 30:14.440
I know it was rejected by you guys.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.590
I just want an explanation. Can't I?

30:15.590 --> 30:16.880
I can answer your questions,

30:16.880 --> 30:18.510
but I can't answer a madman's questions!

30:18.510 --> 30:19.350
I don't need you!

30:19.350 --> 30:20.270
I want to see Li Yifei!

30:20.270 --> 30:21.510
Get out of my way! Step aside!

30:20.390 --> 30:22.700
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

30:21.510 --> 30:22.640
Lu Ze, calm down!

30:22.960 --> 30:24.760
We can talk about this properly.

30:25.480 --> 30:26.790
Come on, talk about it.

30:27.370 --> 30:29.100
Talk about it properly, right?

30:30.370 --> 30:31.060
Fine.

30:32.940 --> 30:34.350
I just want to know why.

30:34.750 --> 30:36.110
I put in so much effort

30:36.110 --> 30:37.720
and finally found a new investor

30:37.720 --> 30:39.110
to take over Xinxin Vision,

30:39.110 --> 30:40.030
but Li Yifei,

30:40.310 --> 30:41.980
you rejected this plan!

30:42.980 --> 30:44.510
Do you know what this means?

30:44.750 --> 30:46.510
This is pushing me to the brink!

30:46.590 --> 30:47.980
I just don't get it.

30:48.270 --> 30:49.310
As long as he nods,

30:49.720 --> 30:50.670
there will be a win-win

30:50.670 --> 30:51.540
for all 3 parties,

30:51.540 --> 30:54.200
including Shan Li Fang, Xinxin Vision,
and the new investor!

30:54.200 --> 30:54.920
Why?

30:55.100 --> 30:55.960
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

30:55.120 --> 30:55.940
Why?

30:56.030 --> 30:57.720
Tell me why, Li Yifei!

30:57.790 --> 30:58.510
Come out!

30:58.590 --> 30:59.370
Get out of my way!

30:59.370 --> 31:00.200
Come out!

31:00.310 --> 31:01.830
Give me an explanation! Tell me why!

31:01.830 --> 31:04.350
Enough. Stop yelling. Stop it!

31:03.930 --> 31:04.840
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

31:07.400 --> 31:08.830
Zhao De, let him in.

31:10.830 --> 31:12.360
You may all get back to work.

31:21.570 --> 31:25.380
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]
[Director's Office]

31:31.110 --> 31:32.350
You should still remember

31:32.350 --> 31:34.740
my evaluation of your company's project

31:35.680 --> 31:38.010
at the last venture capital forum, right?

31:46.010 --> 31:46.870
Well,

31:47.440 --> 31:48.550
you also watched the roadshow just now.

31:48.550 --> 31:49.330
What do you think?

31:49.330 --> 31:50.310
It's pretty good.

31:50.310 --> 31:52.110
Do you have any specific advice?

31:56.770 --> 31:58.550
Actually,
the financial circle is quite small.

31:58.550 --> 31:59.680
You see, for people in venture capital

31:59.680 --> 32:01.140
and securities,
everyone kind of knows everyone.

32:01.140 --> 32:02.480
So good projects never lack funds.

32:02.480 --> 32:03.940
Everyone fights for them.

32:05.960 --> 32:07.290
But about your project,

32:07.550 --> 32:08.620
I've got some questions

32:08.620 --> 32:10.280
that I'm quite curious about.

32:10.640 --> 32:11.570
Please go ahead.

32:12.750 --> 32:13.280
Firstly,

32:14.880 --> 32:17.080
you are already tied to Shan Li Fang now.

32:18.400 --> 32:20.750
So who owns the patent for this product?

32:21.270 --> 32:22.800
Do you have control over it?

32:23.440 --> 32:24.040
Secondly,

32:25.790 --> 32:26.790
if

32:27.270 --> 32:29.960
Shan Li Fang is only willing
to use this app

32:29.960 --> 32:31.540
for its own hotel brands,

32:32.680 --> 32:35.410
then what's the point
of your fundraising today?

32:35.480 --> 32:36.210
Thirdly,

32:36.880 --> 32:38.370
as you just introduced, this product

32:38.370 --> 32:40.970
still has a year and a half
of development to go.

32:41.550 --> 32:42.200
Besides,

32:42.680 --> 32:43.780
if Shan Li Fang

32:44.110 --> 32:46.440
suddenly suspends its investment in you,

32:47.230 --> 32:49.540
and you can't find
financing channels anytime soon,

32:49.540 --> 32:51.070
do you have any backup plan?

32:53.480 --> 32:54.920
H-Here's the thing.

32:54.920 --> 32:55.650
First of all,

32:55.790 --> 32:57.550
I did sign a contract with Shan Li Fang,

32:57.550 --> 32:59.920
but I have the final say
on how to develop it.

32:59.920 --> 33:01.550
-And...
-Sorry to interrupt.

33:01.550 --> 33:04.280
Do you also have the final say
on how long it takes?

33:04.350 --> 33:05.440
If they insist

33:05.440 --> 33:07.230
on reselling it
as a semi-finished product,

33:07.230 --> 33:08.270
can you say no?

33:09.200 --> 33:09.930
Or let's say,

33:10.050 --> 33:12.530
when Shan Li Fang threatens you

33:12.560 --> 33:14.220
with suspending investment,

33:15.010 --> 33:16.460
do you have an alternative?

33:16.460 --> 33:17.860
Do you have a backup plan?

33:21.330 --> 33:22.660
I will... I will insist.

33:27.680 --> 33:28.340
This...

33:28.360 --> 33:31.490
This is not something you can control
just by insisting.

33:33.780 --> 33:35.310
Mr. Lu, it seems that you're

33:36.090 --> 33:38.220
still not very familiar with capital.

33:40.830 --> 33:42.960
Yes, I'm indeed not very familiar with

33:42.960 --> 33:43.680
capital operations,

33:43.680 --> 33:45.790
because I...
I come from a technical background.

33:45.790 --> 33:46.880
But I can...

33:46.880 --> 33:48.440
So only Shan Li Fang

33:49.200 --> 33:50.860
has control over everything,

33:52.240 --> 33:52.720
right?

33:58.350 --> 33:58.990
Mr. Lu,

33:59.720 --> 34:01.390
if I were an investor

34:02.230 --> 34:04.100
interested in your project,

34:04.130 --> 34:05.030
your answers just now

34:05.030 --> 34:07.230
would have completely changed my mind.

34:07.590 --> 34:09.320
No control
over either the direction or time,

34:09.320 --> 34:11.290
and no certainty
about the return on investment.

34:11.290 --> 34:13.110
All you're offering is an empty promise,

34:13.110 --> 34:14.949
which is even built
on something you don't owe.

34:14.949 --> 34:16.480
And I have to pay for this promise.

34:16.480 --> 34:17.150
Do you think

34:17.880 --> 34:19.010
anyone in this world

34:19.409 --> 34:21.070
would do something so stupid?

34:23.880 --> 34:24.480
So you mean

34:25.030 --> 34:27.429
you're not optimistic about this project.

34:34.280 --> 34:35.949
All right. Since you remember everything,

34:35.949 --> 34:37.360
I'm not going to repeat it.

34:37.360 --> 34:39.080
But I still have to add something.

34:39.080 --> 34:41.710
The product
Xinxin Vision is currently developing

34:41.710 --> 34:43.909
doesn't have high technical barriers,

34:43.940 --> 34:46.030
but is highly dependent on the market.

34:46.030 --> 34:46.960
So I suggest you

34:46.980 --> 34:49.420
not focus only on the hotel industry.

34:49.670 --> 34:51.630
Maybe it can have a better and broader...

34:51.630 --> 34:53.070
So you rejected my investment

34:53.070 --> 34:54.190
just to prove

34:54.190 --> 34:55.780
how right your judgment was back then

34:55.780 --> 34:58.010
and that I was bound to fail, huh?

35:02.000 --> 35:04.110
If you insist on thinking of me this way,

35:04.110 --> 35:06.170
we really don't need to talk anymore.

35:06.440 --> 35:06.880
All right,

35:06.880 --> 35:08.410
I will stop. You talk, okay?

35:14.890 --> 35:16.800
Here, take a look.

35:17.150 --> 35:18.630
These are the acquisition
and loan contracts

35:18.630 --> 35:20.960
previously signed
between Shan Li Fang Hotel

35:20.960 --> 35:22.840
and Xinxin Vision.

35:28.150 --> 35:28.950
I signed them.

35:28.990 --> 35:30.070
Is there any problem?

35:30.070 --> 35:31.670
Then you should know very well

35:31.670 --> 35:32.810
that Shan Li Fang transferred

35:32.810 --> 35:34.980
most of the funds in the form of loans

35:35.070 --> 35:37.200
to Xinxin Vision's account back then.

35:37.270 --> 35:39.000
If new investors want to take over,

35:39.000 --> 35:40.900
they must first pay off the previous loans

35:40.900 --> 35:43.540
instead of just acquiring
the current assets.

35:43.560 --> 35:44.800
You get that, right?

35:50.400 --> 35:51.650
Therefore,

35:52.670 --> 35:54.990
for the sake
of the so-called accounting statistics,

35:54.990 --> 35:57.110
I must reject this new investment.

35:57.110 --> 35:58.310
Is that what you mean?

36:00.690 --> 36:01.480
What else?

36:07.670 --> 36:08.670
A bunch of frauds.

36:09.590 --> 36:11.100
That's how capital works.

36:11.320 --> 36:13.490
And that's how the contract you signed

36:13.520 --> 36:15.180
with Shan Li Fang stipulates.

36:20.880 --> 36:24.950
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

36:36.110 --> 36:37.970
Where is he? Isn't he coming down?

36:40.110 --> 36:40.670
Miss,

36:40.670 --> 36:42.150
Director Wang is having a meeting.

36:42.150 --> 36:43.350
Please wait a moment.

36:43.440 --> 36:44.190
A meeting?

36:47.380 --> 36:49.380
Is Wang Ruohai that afraid to see me?

36:49.760 --> 36:51.440
Sorry, please wait a moment.

36:54.230 --> 36:55.670
I took a day off today

36:55.670 --> 36:57.770
and just finished an event near you.

36:57.880 --> 36:59.070
Are you busy now?

36:59.070 --> 37:01.000
If not, let's grab lunch together.

37:01.030 --> 37:02.110
I'm in your lobby.

37:02.110 --> 37:05.280
What kind of person

37:02.200 --> 37:03.300
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

37:05.280 --> 37:06.230
is Wang Ruohai, the CFO

37:06.230 --> 37:07.760
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group?

37:11.030 --> 37:12.050
Director Wang.

37:12.880 --> 37:13.940
You are here again.

37:14.280 --> 37:16.610
-What's going on?
-You finally showed up.

37:17.340 --> 37:20.030
The wound on your face healed pretty fast.

37:21.840 --> 37:23.570
Get in and have a glass of water.

37:24.510 --> 37:25.670
Don't touch me,

37:26.590 --> 37:27.670
lest people misunderstand

37:27.670 --> 37:30.360
that there's something shady
going on between us.

37:30.360 --> 37:32.460
I think it's spacious and bright here,

37:32.460 --> 37:33.950
perfect for us to talk.

37:34.510 --> 37:35.670
It's perfect for you, right?

37:35.670 --> 37:36.730
You could say that.

37:37.110 --> 37:37.920
Just a moment.

37:51.480 --> 37:52.440
So much money.

37:53.070 --> 37:54.550
And it's all in cash.

37:54.710 --> 37:56.510
500,000 yuan, no more, no less.

37:59.920 --> 38:00.960
Record it.

38:00.960 --> 38:02.880
Jingjing is really something.

38:07.190 --> 38:08.000
What?

38:08.000 --> 38:09.870
I'm here to pay you back.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.670
When you two broke up,

38:11.670 --> 38:12.950
you said clearly

38:12.970 --> 38:14.920
that there was no rush
to return your money.

38:14.920 --> 38:17.030
Why did you go back on your word?

38:17.550 --> 38:19.130
You even used a job opportunity

38:19.130 --> 38:22.330
to threaten and force your ex-girlfriend
to pay you back.

38:22.400 --> 38:24.360
It's okay. You're ruthless.

38:24.380 --> 38:26.240
But I still brought you the money.

38:26.280 --> 38:27.340
Count it right here

38:27.400 --> 38:29.250
and promise in front of everyone

38:29.670 --> 38:31.820
that you will never harass Qian Fei again.

38:31.820 --> 38:33.480
Then this matter will be over.

38:33.840 --> 38:35.520
Please take the money
and leave immediately,

38:35.520 --> 38:36.850
or I will call security.

38:37.880 --> 38:39.000
Just keep it!

38:43.800 --> 38:45.510
Hello, I am the person in charge here.

38:45.510 --> 38:46.420
If you have any problems,

38:46.420 --> 38:48.510
we can solve them properly in my office.

38:48.510 --> 38:50.970
Please don't disturb
the other guests here.

38:51.510 --> 38:52.770
So you're the person in charge, huh?

38:52.770 --> 38:54.960
Then I won't hide anything.

38:55.110 --> 38:56.480
The main reason I'm here today

38:56.480 --> 38:57.760
is to expose the filthy conduct

38:57.760 --> 38:59.960
of your Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's CFO,

38:59.980 --> 39:01.400
Wang Ruohai.

39:01.440 --> 39:02.680
We will have a fair judgment

39:02.680 --> 39:04.750
about what kind of person he is.

39:05.110 --> 39:06.990
But you're making a scene here
for sensationalism.

39:06.990 --> 39:09.360
You're clearly trying
to damage our hotel's reputation.

39:09.360 --> 39:11.690
I suspect you were sent by our competitor.

39:11.760 --> 39:13.690
I have the right to ask you to leave.

39:16.000 --> 39:17.200
What's going on here?

39:17.510 --> 39:19.320
It's nothing. I'll handle it.

39:19.540 --> 39:21.030
You arranged all of this, didn't you?

39:21.030 --> 39:23.170
No, I came by myself.

39:25.550 --> 39:26.600
What the hell are they doing?

39:26.600 --> 39:28.000
What is this woman doing?

39:29.800 --> 39:31.060
What's going on there?

39:31.440 --> 39:32.590
They're exposing a mistress.

39:32.590 --> 39:34.630
You cheated and had an affair!
Shame on you!

39:34.630 --> 39:35.480
You've gone too far.

39:35.480 --> 39:36.190
So she's a mistress.

39:36.190 --> 39:37.480
Let this slide.

39:37.550 --> 39:38.360
Let's go first.

39:38.360 --> 39:39.360
How can we just leave?

39:39.360 --> 39:40.690
How can we just let it go?

39:40.850 --> 39:42.440
How can you be manipulated
by someone like him?

39:42.440 --> 39:43.180
Doesn't he want money?

39:43.180 --> 39:45.280
Just give it back to him!
Hey, take the 500,000 yuan!

39:45.280 --> 39:45.760
You know what?

39:45.760 --> 39:48.150
This kind of person
only cares about money.

39:48.150 --> 39:50.110
You're disrupting
our company's normal operations.

39:50.110 --> 39:51.170
I will make you

39:51.190 --> 39:52.760
compensate for the hotel's losses

39:52.760 --> 39:54.160
through legal channels.

39:54.670 --> 39:56.600
Regarding the personal slander
against me and Director Wang,

39:56.600 --> 39:58.800
I reserve the right to take legal action

39:58.800 --> 40:00.660
and may file a lawsuit at any time.

40:01.110 --> 40:02.760
Fine, feel free to do so.

40:06.170 --> 40:07.230
What are you doing?

40:07.230 --> 40:07.710
Don't touch me!

40:07.710 --> 40:08.400
Please get out of here!

40:08.400 --> 40:09.150
Let go!

40:09.150 --> 40:10.010
Please leave!

40:10.670 --> 40:12.320
You call for backup when you can't win
an argument, huh?

40:12.320 --> 40:15.000
What are you doing? What are you doing?

40:15.000 --> 40:16.030
Tell him to stop!

40:16.150 --> 40:17.070
What are you doing? Let go!

40:17.070 --> 40:17.880
Don't touch my wife!

40:17.880 --> 40:19.360
What are you doing? Hands off!

40:19.360 --> 40:21.050
Let go! I said, let go!

40:21.230 --> 40:22.490
Let go! Don't touch me!

40:22.510 --> 40:23.480
Stop!

40:30.560 --> 40:31.320
Are you okay?

40:31.320 --> 40:32.250
Why are you here?

40:32.760 --> 40:33.620
What happened?

40:35.030 --> 40:36.830
I'm paying back Qian Fei's debt.

40:41.630 --> 40:42.160
Qian Fei.

40:44.150 --> 40:45.150
My mom is sick.

40:47.840 --> 40:48.900
I'm short of money.

40:49.400 --> 40:50.670
I want my money back.

40:50.710 --> 40:52.040
What's wrong with that?

41:05.930 --> 41:07.620
We used to be best friends.

41:08.840 --> 41:10.280
Everyone has hard times.

41:12.040 --> 41:14.440
And right now is
the hardest time of my life.

41:14.840 --> 41:17.230
Why are you doing this to me?

41:25.890 --> 41:26.760
I'm sorry.

41:27.370 --> 41:29.300
I didn't know your mother was sick.

41:30.800 --> 41:33.550
Getting her treated is the priority.

41:34.580 --> 41:36.870
I'll find a way to pay you back.

41:37.230 --> 41:38.950
As for the 500,000 yuan, how about you...

41:38.950 --> 41:39.410
What?

41:40.110 --> 41:42.510
It seems
that you're involved in this, too.

41:42.860 --> 41:44.370
Miss Liao, what do you mean by that?

41:44.370 --> 41:45.480
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

41:45.480 --> 41:47.110
spun off your subsidiary

41:47.230 --> 41:48.920
for the bigger picture of the IPO.

41:48.920 --> 41:50.400
What? You're unhappy,

41:50.400 --> 41:52.320
so you got someone to mess around?

41:52.630 --> 41:55.030
This is a pretty low trick,
don't you think?

42:05.590 --> 42:08.050
Help me contact
a few social media accounts.

42:08.230 --> 42:09.880
Yes. Let's have dinner together.

42:09.880 --> 42:10.680
Make it quick.

42:11.320 --> 42:13.320
I'll tell you the details in the car.

42:17.110 --> 42:18.590
Ruohai, let's go.

42:23.320 --> 42:24.280
Move along, everyone. Move.

42:24.280 --> 42:25.810
-Just go back.
-Go back now.

42:28.150 --> 42:29.110
Are you okay?

42:29.190 --> 42:29.800
Wait a minute.

42:29.800 --> 42:31.000
Move along...

42:31.630 --> 42:33.400
What did she mean by that just now?

42:33.400 --> 42:35.730
What happened to the company? "Spun off"?

42:39.070 --> 42:40.470
You haven't told her yet?

42:42.150 --> 42:44.150
You haven't told her either, right?

42:45.510 --> 42:46.360
Wait, hold on.

42:46.580 --> 42:47.780
You two both knew

42:48.070 --> 42:49.130
but didn't tell me.

42:49.760 --> 42:50.440
Right?

42:52.200 --> 42:53.790
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:53.940 --> 42:55.270
Let me be more specific.

42:55.610 --> 42:56.790
I don't want it

42:57.320 --> 42:59.400
to affect our sponsor team's work.

42:59.710 --> 43:02.200
So please resolve it as soon as possible

43:02.290 --> 43:04.020
and go apologize to Liao Shiyu.

43:04.110 --> 43:04.930
I won't do it.

43:04.950 --> 43:07.340
When Fulaxida starts making money,

43:07.450 --> 43:08.530
you can make a list,

43:08.560 --> 43:09.960
and I'll buy them for you.

43:10.240 --> 43:12.150
Helping your landlady this much,

43:13.070 --> 43:14.400
are you really into her?

43:15.830 --> 43:17.800
My mom used to sew my clothes
like this, too.

43:17.800 --> 43:18.860
Take it and wear it.

43:18.990 --> 43:19.820
Remember to pay.
